@startuml
title UML State Transition Diagram - Video Suggestion System

[*] --> UserSuggestionRequest : Receive suggestion request

state "User suggestion request" as UserSuggestionRequest
state "User identification" as UserIdentification
state "Gather suggested videos" as GatherSuggestedVideos
state "Add video details" as AddVideoDetails
state "Send suggestions" as SendSuggestions

UserSuggestionRequest --> UserIdentification : Identify user [valid]
UserSuggestionRequest --> [*] : Handle unknown user [invalid]

UserIdentification --> GatherSuggestedVideos : Gather based on profile

GatherSuggestedVideos --> AddVideoDetails : Videos found
GatherSuggestedVideos --> [*] : No videos found

AddVideoDetails --> SendSuggestions : Ready to send

SendSuggestions --> [*] : Suggestions sent
SendSuggestions --> [*] : User notified of issue [invalid]

@enduml
